-- TEXT: the numeric str-edge on input that is not a number. §12 B-13 makes
-- this an EDGE and B-14 makes an unconsumed failure a diagnostic. Measured:
-- it answers 0 and reports nothing, so a parse failure is indistinguishable
-- from the successful parse of "0".
-- expect: 0
main = (): i64
    a = to(i64)("abc")
    print("{a}")
    0
end
